    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Unregulated Burning in Belize City</h1>
      <p>Unregulated burning harms our health and environment. Our project shows the data, solutions, and SDG 3 impact.</p>
      <p class="stat"> 65% of residents report coughing from smoke</p>
      <a href="#about" class="cta">Explore the project</a>
    </div>
